  "stop_words_comment": "Words that stop a capture outright: a message carrying one of them describes a payment that did not happen, so no expense, review entry or request is produced from it. Matching is the same token-sequence match as the other lists, which is exact per token — a form with diacritics and one without are two entries, because a bank message may arrive either way. Every entry can be switched off on the device."
